  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes QAOA‑in‑QAOA (QAOA2), a hierarchical divide‑and‑conquer approach that solves large MaxCut instances by running many small QAOA subproblems. Using a 10‑qubit simulator with p=1 QAOA and 20 training iterations, the authors approximate MaxCut on 2000‑vertex graphs and report approximation ratios roughly comparable to the classical Goemans–Williamson algorithm (differences typically ~10⁻⁴). No runtime speedup or hardware experiment is demonstrated.",
